<title>CANADA: Croatia buys a Bombardier CL-415 plane.</title>
<headline>Croatia buys a Bombardier CL-415 plane.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombardier Inc said on Friday that the Republic of Crotia bought a Canadair CL-415 amphibious aircraft.</p>
<p>The value of the contract is about US$22 million, including training and support services. The delivery date is January.</p>
<p>The sale brings to 27 the number of CL-415 aircraft sold to date. Other countries buying the plane are Canada, France and Italy.</p>
<p>The CL-415 is an amphibious aircraft designed for firefighting.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
